    {
      "text": "A bilingual 'COVID-19 Vaccination Certificate / Certificat de vaccination contre la Covid-19' with the WHO emblem in English and French, a blank 'Issued to / Délivré à' line and a QR code. In Figure 2 it is format 3, a handwritten paper certificate with a health certificate identifier or a 2D barcode. On the rendered page the WHO emblem and title are covered by the label 'National COVID-19 Certificate'.",
